<p. 2> ādikartā kaviḥ sākṣācchūlapāṇiriti śrutiḥ |
aṣṭādaśa purāṇāni kathitāni samāsataḥ ||
teṣāṃ sargāntareṣveva dvāpare darśako muniḥ |
vyāso yathā mahādevaḥ kāmikādiprakāśakaḥ ||
aṣṭādaśapurāṇānāṃ kartā satyavatīsutaḥ |
kāmikādiprabhedasya yathā devo maheśvaraḥ ||

	iti vāyavyasaṃhitā dharmasaṃhitā sūtasaṃhitā śrutibhiśca 
yathā kāmikādīnāṃ śivenaiva praṇayanāt | prāmāṇye yathāpi 
nārāyaṇāvatāreṇa vyāsena praṇayanāt prāmāṇye'pi asāvavaśiṣṭa iti 
sūtasaṃhitā prativacanācca | vedānāṃ śivāgamānāṃ ca 
paramāptaparaśivakṛtakatvenaiva prāmāṇyam | nākṛtakatvena | 
kālidāsādivākyavadvarṇapadavākyaracanāvatvāt | satkāryatayā vedāḥ 
nityā iti cecchivāgamāśca | nāsato vidyate bhāvo nābhāvo vidyate sata iti 
vacanāt | tathevyabhivyaktikartṛtvaṃ śivasya siddhamityakṛtakatvaṃ vā'stu 
|
taduktaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ 

vedo'nādiḥ śivastasya vyañjakaḥ paramārthataḥ |
abhivyaktimapekṣyaiva praṇatetyucyate budhairiti ||

<p. 3> tathā sahasranāmavyākhyāyāṃ kṛtāgamāyetyatra kṛtāḥ praṇītā 
āgamāḥ kāraṇakāmikādyāstantraviśeṣā yena saḥ kṛtāgamastathā 
coktaḥ 

	kāmikādyā vātulāntāḥ śivenoktāḥ śivāgamā 
ityalaṅkāradīkṣitena vyākhyātam | tataḥ śivakṛtakatvenaivobhayoḥ 
prāmāṇyam | taduktaṃ caturvedārthatātparyasaṃgrahe 

vedāḥ pramāṇamiti saṃgiramāṇa eva
divyaṃ tavāgamamavaiti janaḥ prāṇam (pramāṇam) |
tvaddhyānavākyaviṣayaupayime(kaiḥ) padārthai (******)
kalitavigrahamā ca mūlāt ||

kalpāḥ pramāṇamṛṣibhiryadi naḥ praṇītāḥ 
kiṃ naḥ pramāṇamṛṣiṇāṃ mahatāṃ maharṣe 
śakyaṃ na vaktuṃ parigrahadūṣitāni
tantrāntarāṇi bhavatā śivakartṛmantīti ||

vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ ca(-)

ajātāśeṣadoṣeṇa sarvajñena śivena (*) |
(******) ṇītamamalaṃ vākyaṃ tat pramāṇaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

tasmādīśvaravākyāni śraddheyāni vipaścitā | 
yathārthaṃ puṇyapāpeṣu tadaśraddho vrajatyadha iti ||

<p. 4> tataḥ parasparaṃ vedānāmiva parasparopabṛṃhaṇatvamantarā 
svatantratvenaivobhayeṣāṃ prāmāṇyaṃ | taduktaṃ mataṅge 

pramāṇamekaṃ tadvākyaṃ tathyamīśvarabhāṣitam | iti |

pauṣkare'pi 

	pramāṇamekaṃ tadvākyaṃ tathyaṃ śreyonidhiḥ sadeti | tathā 
vyākhyātaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ vidyāraṇyasvāmibhirapi 
śivapūjāprakrame 

vaidikī tāntrikī ce (*) dvijendrāstāntrikī tu sā |
tāntrikasyaiva nānyasya vaidikī vaidikasya hīti ||

atra vedatanmūlasmṛtipurāṇādipratipāditaprakārā vaidikī | 
tadanapekṣaśivaproktakāmikādyāgamapratipāditaprakārā tāntrikī | tatra 
tāntrakyā adhikāriviśeṣamāha | tāntrikasyaiveti | 
tatroditakuṇḍamaṇḍalādipurassaradīkṣādisaṃskṛtasyaivetyartha iti | tathā 
hi |

	na hi parasparaṃ vedānāmiva svatantraprayuktaśivāgamānāṃ 
vedabāhyatvam | vedasāramidaṃ tantramiti vedotkṛṣṭavedaviśeṣatva (******) 
samuktatvāt | taduktaṃ śaivapurāṇasaṃbhavavāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ 

bhagavañcchrotumicchāmaḥ śivena paribhāṣitam |
<p. 5> vedasāraṃ śivajñānaṃ saṃśrutāṃ (saṃśrutānāṃ) vimuktaya iti 
| makuṭe ca 

vedasāramidaṃ tantraṃ tasmādvaidika ācaret |
vedāntārthamayaṃ jñānaṃ siddhāntaṃ paramaṃ śubham ||
ūrdhvasrotodbhavaṃ śreṣṭhamaṣṭāviṃśatitantrakam |
vedasārārthadaṃ jñeyamanyattvanyārthasādhanamiti ||

suprabhede 

śaivaṃ pāśupataṃ somaṃ lākulaṃ ca caturvidham |
teṣu śaivaṃ paraṃ saumyaṃ raudraṃ pāśupatādikam ||
kāmikādyaṣṭaviṃśacca tantraṃ śaivamiti smṛtam |
tadeva saumyamākhyātaṃ siddhāntaṃ hi tadeva tu ||
tadanyadraudramākhyātaṃ tantraṃ pāśupatādikamiti |

kāmike ca 

siddhāntaṃ vedasāratvādanyadvedavahiṣkṛtam |
siddhānte vihitācāro vaidikācāra ucyate ||
karttavyaṃ cedanuṣṭheyaṃ śaivakarmāvirodhi yat |
viruddhaṃ cet parityājyaṃ na tu śaivaṃ parityajet ||
saṃgrāhyaṃ vaidikaṃ sarvaṃ śaivavākyāvirodhi yat |
śaivaṃ vaidikamevoktaṃ vaidikaṃ śaivameva ca ||

<p. 6> vaidikāntarbahirbhūtaṃ śaivaṃ śaivāttadapyadhaḥ |
tathāpi vaidikācchreṣṭhaṃ śaivaṃ tasmāt paraṃ nahi ||
siddhāntaṃ kāmikādi syāt nāsmātparamanuttamam |
śaivaṃ tu mūlabhūtaṃ syāt caturvedāstadudbhavāḥ ||
tathāpi vaidikaṃ vedasāramityādivākyataḥ |
śaivaṃ proktaṃ ca sarvatra tadarthaikyānmunīśvarā iti ||

nanu vedasāraṃ śrautamasvatantraṃ tantramanyat | 
punaravedasāramaśrautaṃ kāmikādikaṃ svatantraṃ tantramanyat |

taduktaṃ vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ 

śaivāgamo'pi dvividhaḥ śrautāśrautaśca saṃsmṛtaḥ |
śrutisāramayaśrauta svatantra itaro mataḥ ||
svatantro daśadhā pūrvaṃ tathāṣṭādaśadhā punaḥ |
kāmikādisamākhyābhiḥ siddhaḥ siddhāntasaṃjñitaḥ ||
śrutisāramayo'nyastu śatakoṭipravistaraḥ |
paraṃ pāśupataṃ yatra vrataṃ jñānaṃ ca kathyata iti ||

tadevaṃ sthite kathaṃ kāmikādikaṃ vedasāramiti makuṭādiṣūktam | 
satyam | śrautatvāpādakaṃ vedasāratvaṃ dviprakāram | tatra prathamaṃ 
śaivapāśupatapratītatantravaidikapāśupataprameyapravistārakaśatakoṭipra
vistare kasmiṃścidadya 
<p. 7>  yāvadaṣṭasiddhā svatantraṃ tatra dṛṣṭaṃ vedasāratvaṃ 
vedānusāritvam |
dvitīyasiddhāntaprameyapravistārakapadārthādipravistare svatantratantre 
kāmikādike dṛṣṭam | vedasāratvaṃ tu na hi 
dadhyādernavanītādivadvedādutpannatvaṃ vedānusāritvaṃ 
vedavyāpyatvaṃ vā | anyacca kiñciduktamapi | vedānusāritvaṃ 
vedārthasvīkāratvamityarthaḥ | tattvena vedavyāpakatvāt | taduktaṃ 
vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ 

yaduktamanyathāstreṣu vidyate tacchivāgame |
na dṛṣṭaṃ yacchivajñāne tadanyatra na vidyata iti ||

kāmike ca 

siddhāntāt paramaṃ jñānaṃ neti śāstrasya niścayaḥ |
anyathāstreṣu (-----------------------------------------------------) ||

aṣṭāviṃśatitantrāṇi siddhāntamiti kīrttitamiti |

cintyaviśve ca 

śaivaṃ pāśupataṃ jñeyaṃ sarvatattvaikanāyakam |
sarvamantramayaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvadevamayaṃ bhavet ||
janmāntaratapobhiśca sanmārgajñānasaṃbhavamiti |

aruṇācalamāhātmye ca 

nāsti śoṇādritaḥ kṣetraṃ nāstipañcākṣarānmanuḥ |
nāsti māheśvarāddharmo nāsti śāstraṃ śivāgamāditi ||
<p. 8> kiṃ tu pramāṇavirodhasya svataḥ prameyavirodhamūlatvāt | 
parasparaṃ vedānāmiva kathañcit 
kvacitkiñcidekātmavādādiprameyapradeśapratipādanaprakāravirodha(-)
mātraparityāgena vedavihitavidhiniṣedhakatvavaidhuryeṇa 
bahuśo'rthaikyādavirodhavedācāravedārthasvīkāreṇa 
śaivavedaviśāradāniti suprabhedakṛte svātantryeṇa 
vedādhigatānadhigatārthagantṛtvalakṣaṇavedajanakavedaviśeṣaśivāgama
nāmaśivavedatvameva vedasāratvamiti paryavasitārthaḥ 
manuṣyajanakamanuṣyatvaviśeṣabrāhmaṇatvavat |
taduktaṃ mokṣakārikāsu 

pāśadṛṣṭivirodhāya pravṛttamapi mānatām |
na jahāti yataścedyāṃ pāśāstasyeha sarvataḥ ||
na ca svagocare tāsāṃ bādhate tatpramāṇatām |
tāsu varṇāśramācārā na hyanujñānavacca tat ||
na cānyena pramāṇena saṃruddhastasya gocara iti |
viśorapi ca karttavyaṃ patyuṃ preraṇapūrvakamiti ca |

mohaśūrottare ca 

purāṇaṃ sādhyate vedairāgamaiśca taduktayaḥ |
sāmānyaṃ ca viśeṣaṃ ca śaivaṃ vaiśiṣṭikaṃ vaca iti ||

<p. 9> vṛddhācalamāhātmye ca 

etāstu mūrttīḥ parameśvarasya
vṛddhācaleśālayamaṇḍapeṣu |
sthāneṣu saṃsthāpya cakāra pūjāṃ 
śivāgamaproktaviśeṣamārgairiti ||

punaratrāyaṃ vivekaḥ | bahudhā vedaviruddhārthapratipādakatvameva 
vedabāhyatvaṃ na sarvadhā | tathātve 
śivaśāstretaracārvākādisarvaśāstrāṇāmapi 
yathākathañcidviruddhārthapratipādakatvamastīti na sarvadhā (******) 
bāhyānīti yathānurūpaṃ pramāṇāni saphalānyeva | taduktaṃ 
śivāgame gurukṛtau ca 

cārvā (******) bhūtasaṃsiddhā(ḥ) smārtāstanmātrasaṃhatau |
vaiśeṣikāstvahaṅkāre mānasāścendriyā api ||

buddhitattve sthitā bauddhāstatattve nyāyavā (******) ||

ārhatāstu guṇe tattve prakṛtau pāñcarātrakāḥ |
vedāntajñāśca sāṃkhyāśca yoginaḥ puruṣe sthitāḥ ||
śaiva paurāṇikā rāge somā vidyāpade sthitāḥ |
kāpālāstu kalāniṣṭhāḥ kāle kāleśvarā(ḥ) sthitāḥ ||
(******) śāḥ kalāntasthāḥ pṛthak tasmānna coditāḥ |
pāśupatāstu māyāyāṃ vidyāyāṃ tu mahāvratāḥ ||
<p. 10> pravāheśvarakāstvīśe prayojyakartṛkā api |
ye sadāśivatattvasthāḥ śivasaṃbandhavādinaḥ |
śaktau śāktāḥ śive śaivāḥ sāmā (******) smṛtā budhaiḥ |
siddhāntī śivasāyujya siddhimanu (*) ri sthita iti |
tadidameva śivasāyujyamapīdṛguktam 

nāmnaśchedo'pavargo na ca paśuśivayoraikyamatrāpavargo 
nāvidyāgrāsahānirna ca guṇavilayo nāpi pāṣāṇamuktiḥ | 
yadbodhānandarūpaṃ trimalavigamane vyaktamātmasvarūpaṃ tat 
sāyujyena vācyaṃ śivasadṛśavibhuḥ śaivatantre'pavargaḥ || iti ||

tataḥ sākṣānmaharṣitvena śrutisiddhaśivakṛtakatvenaiva śivaśāstrasya 
sāmānyārṣasūtraśāstrāderutkṛṣṭatvaṃ cānuktvā siddham | tasmāt 
sūtasaṃhitādike 

adhaḥ srotodbhavāddharmādūrdhvasrotodbhavaḥ paraḥ |
ūrdhvasrotodbhavāddharmāt smārtadharmo mahattaraḥ ||
smārtebhyaḥ srautadharmāśca variṣṭhā munisattamā iti |

kvacidarthamanyathoktamapi taduktiramalaśivamahāvākyena bādhyate | 
śivāgamasya vedādutkṛṣṭatvamīśānamukhādutpattiśruteḥ |

<p. 11> taduktaṃ śrīmaddhālāsyamāhātmye 

śivajñānāni divyāni kārikādīni bhūsurāḥ |
śrīmaddhālāsyanāthasya saṃbhavantyūrdhvavaktrataḥ ||

punaḥ sa devadevasya puruṣākhyena vaktrataḥ |
ekaviṃśatibhedena yuktaṃ ṛgvedamabravīt ||

yajurvedaṃ caikaśataṃ (-----------------------------------------------------) |
sahasrabhedasahitaṃ sāmavedaṃ tu vāmataḥ ||

atharvaṃ navadhā bhaktaṃ sadyojātena cābravīditi |

śrīkāmike ca 

īśānavaktrādūrdhvastha (******) kādikam |
ṛgyajussāmātharvāśca puruṣādya (******) ||
(******) mantratantrākhyaṃ sadāśivamukhodgatam |
siddhāntaṃ gāruḍaṃ vāmaṃ bhūtatantraṃ ca bhairavam ||

ūrdhvapūrvakuberāpyayāmyavaktrādyathākramamiti |

tasmādāptaparamātmobhayāptapraṇītānāṃ 
cārvākādiśaivasiddhāntānāṃ sarveṣāṃ śāstrāṇāṃ 
pratyakṣādipramāṇānāmiva 
yathānurūpamadhigatānadhigatārthagantṛtvena 
bādhyabādhakasāmānyaviśeṣavyāpyavyāpakataṭasthalakṣaṇasvarūpa(-)
sādhyasādhakasāvadhiniravadhi prāmāṇyaṃ siddham | na hi 
svasthamatamekaikaṃ pramāṇam | tathā svīkāre 

<p. 12> sugato yadi sarvajñaḥ kapilo neti kā pramā |
athobhāvapi sarvajñau matibhedastayoḥ kathamiti nirvaktumaśakyatvāt | 
sarvāṇi śāstrāṇi apramāṇāni syurityaniṣṭaṃ jagadāndhyamāpatet | 
tataḥ sarvāṇi śāstrāṇi svasvāvadhipramāṇānyeva | tathā sādhitaṃ 
śrīrāmakaṇṭhaśivācāryeṇa rauravavṛttiviveke |

taduktaṃ ca pauṣkare 

anyo'pi mārgo vedādiḥ paśupāśārthadarśakaḥ |
svoktatattvāvadhivyāptirbrahmaviṣṇvādikartṛkaḥ || iti ||

paratvānmokṣamārgasya sthitasvargādibhogadaḥ |
na cārṣaṃ pauruṣairvākyai ṛṣibhirdaivikaṃ tathā ||

na devairbrahmaṇo vākyaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ padmajanmanā |
tathā raudraṃ na hariṇā na rudreṇa śivātmakam ||

bādhyamūrdhvordhvavaiśiṣyādadho'dho bādhyamūrdhvataḥ |
śivāgamāvirodhena śāstraṃ sarvaṃ vyavasthitam ||

nānyaśāstrāvirodhena tatsaṃvādatayāthavā |
śivaśāstraṃ vyavasthāpyaṃ tadvyavasthāpakaṃ yataḥ ||

<p. 13> yasya yasya hi śāstrasya yāvatī vyāptiriṣyate |
tāvatyeva bhavedviprāḥ prāmāṇyaṃ tasya tasya ceti ||

sūtagītāyāmapi sūcitam 

tantroktena prakāreṇa devatā yā pratiṣṭhitā |
sā suvandyā susevyā ca vandanīyā ca vaidikaiḥ ||

rājā tu vaidikān sarvān tāntrikānakhilānapi |
asaṅkīrṇatayā nityaṃ sthāpayenmatimattamaḥ ||

annapānādibhirvastraiḥ sarvān rājābhirakṣayediti |
nanu pūrvaṃ vedādikaṃ sarvaṃ śāstraṃ śivakartṛkamityuktam | 
idānīmanyo'pi mārgo vedādibrahmaviṣṇvādikartṛka iti |
brahmaviṣṇvādikartṛkamityuktam | mahān virodhaḥ | satyam | vedādikaṃ 
sarvaṃ śāstraṃ śivaśāstraṃ ca mahāmāyāyāṃ nādātmanā 
prathamaṃ śivavaktrataḥ varṇapadavākyaracanātmanā punaḥ 
sādhikaraṇaniradhikaraṇaśivakṛtamiti na ko'pi virodhaḥ |

taduktaṃ śrīmatkāmike 

laukikaṃ vaidikaṃ caiva tathādhyātmakameva ca |
atimārgaṃ ca mantrākhyaṃ tantramekamanekadhā ||

<p. 14> siddhāntaṃ mantratantraṃ syādatimārgaṃ tato varam |
adhyātmāya tato nīcaṃ tasmādvaidikameva ca ||

vaidikāllaukikaṃ hīnaṃ brahmādyāḥ pañca devatāḥ |
sadyo vāmamahāghorapuruṣeśānamūrtayaḥ ||

pratyekaṃ pañcavaktrāḥ syustairuktaṃ laukikādikam |
sadyamantrādviniṣkrānto brahmā nāmākhilārthadṛk ||

tena vai laukikaṃ śāstraṃ martyaloke'vatāri (******) |
śabdaśāstramalaṅkāraṃ niruktaṃ chanda eva ca ||

kau (******) bhārataṃ jyotiśśāstraṃ vātsyāyanādikam |
āyuśśāstraṃ dhanuśśāstraṃ vṛkṣāyurveda eva ca ||

lokāyataṃ tathā sāṃkhyamarhato matameva ca |
mīmāṃsā daṇḍanītiśca vārtādyaṃ laukikaṃ (******) ||

dhāmamantrādhipo viṣṇuḥ kāraṇeśo dvitīyakaḥ ||

tena vaidikamuddiṣṭamaṣṭādaśapurāṇakam ||

dharmaśāstraṃ ca vedāntaṃ pāñcarātraṃ ca bauddhakam |
rudro ghorādviniṣkrāntastvadhyātmaṃ ca praṇītavān ||

nyāyavaiśeṣikaṃ sāṃkhyaṃ (******) raṃ ca praṇītavān |
īśvaraḥ puruṣājjātastvanimārgaṃ praṇītavān || 

<p. 15> pañcārdhaṃ lākulaṃ cānyattathā pāśupataṃ matam |
sadāśivo'pi bhagavān mantratantramapālayat ||

uktāni pratiṣiddhāni punaḥ sambhāṣitāni ca |
sāpekṣanirapekṣāṇi śivavākyānyanekadhā ||

ūrdhvasrotodbhavaṃ sarvamanantādīnabodhayat |
tenoktaṃ parameśena śrīkaṇṭhāya mahātmane ||

ādāvabhūddvidhā jñānamadhikāravibhedataḥ |
parāpareṇa bhedena patipāśātmadarśakam ||

śivaprakāśakaṃ jñānaṃ śivajñānaṃ paraṃ smṛtam |
vedādyaparavijñānaṃ paśupāśārthadarśakam ||

yathāvidhikṣaṇaṃ cakṣuḥ kṣapāyāṃ nṛbilālayoḥ |
tathā vilakṣaṇaṃ jñānaṃ evametat parāparam ||

jyotirjñānarataṃ vedapurāṇāhitacetasā |
tatsiddhapuruṣārtheṣu kṛtayatnaṃ parityajet ||

kāmikādiśivajñānaṃ vedārthajñānameva ca |
samaṃ yo manyate mohāttaṃ prayatnena varjayediti ||

punastatraiva 

gāruḍaṃ bhūtatantraṃ ca bhairavaṃ vāmamantrakam |
kāpālaṃ pāñcarātraṃ ca lākulaṃ kulaśāstrakam ||

<p. 16> itihāsaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ ca ṛgyajussāmasaṃjñakam |
atharvaṇaṃ tathā bauddhamarhato matameva ca ||

ūrdhvasrotodbhavācchāstrādapaśāntamukhakramāt |
kāmikādiśivajñānaṃ mūrdhā bhagavataḥ sadā ||

itarāṇi maheśasya hṛtkaṇṭhādyaṅgakāni vai |
pūrvapakṣatayā tāni kathitānīha śambhunā ||

heyopādeyavastūnāṃ nirṇaye paramārthataḥ |
tatsarvamadharīkṛtya śivasiddhānta īrita iti ||

	tathā mahābhārate ca vedādeḥ sādhikaraṇaśivakṛtakatvamuktam |
yugānte'ntarhitān vedān itihāsān maharṣayaḥ ||

lebhire tapasā pūrvamanujñātāḥ svayambhuveti |

vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ ca(-)

āmnāyasiddhamakhilaṃ dharmāśramiṇāmiha |
brahmaṇā kalpitaṃ pūrvaṃ mamaivājñāpurassarau ||

sa tu paitāmaho dharmo bahuvittakriyānvitaḥ |
nātyantaphalabhūyiṣṭhakleśāyāsasamanvitaḥ ||

tena dharmeṇa mahatā śraddhāṃ prāpya sudurlabhām |
varṇino ye prapadyante māmananyasamāśrayāḥ ||

<p. 17> teṣāṃ sukhena mārgeṇa dharmakāmārthamuktaye |
varṇāśramasamācāro mayā bhūtaḥ prakalpitaḥ ||

tasmin bhaktimatāmeva madīyānāṃ tu varṇinām |
adhikāro na cānyeṣāmityājñā naiṣṭhikī mameti ||

ataḥ śrutipathagalitānāṃ mānuṣāṇāṃ tu tantramityuktaṃ tantraṃ na 
śivāgamaḥ | tathā kṛte śivādadhītaśivatantrāṇāṃ sanakādīnāṃ 
śvetopamanyukṛṣṇārjunamārkaṇḍeyaprabhṛtīnāṃ ca 
śrutipathagalitārthaśrutyanadhikāritvaprasaṅgāt | teṣāṃ 
cādhītaśivāgamatvamuktaṃ skānde sambhavakāṇḍe 

etasminnantare devaḥ kailāse rajatācale |
sanakādimunīndrebhyastripadārthārthasammitam ||

rahasyamāgamāmnākhyaṃ siddhāntaṃ kathayaṃsthita iti |

upadeśakāṇḍe ca 

purā brahmātmajāḥ puṇyāḥ sanakaśca sanātanaḥ |
sanandanaśca bhagavān sanatpūrvakumārakaḥ ||

catvāro ṛṣayaḥ śambhoḥ pūjāṃ puṇyāṃ vidhāya ca |
prasannena tato vedācchivenādhyāpitāḥ khalu ||

āgamāṃśca purāṇāni setihāsāni suvratāḥ |
śivārcanaparā nityaṃ śivayogena pāvanaḥ(nāḥ) ||

	śivajñānāgninā dagdhamahāpātakasañcayā iti |

śivapurāṇe kāñcīpuramāhātmye ca 

sanatkumāraḥ papraccha sāñjaliḥ kamalāsanam |
bhagavan sakalā vedāḥ sāṅgopāṅgāḥ sasaṃhitāḥ ||

śivāgamāstathā sarve vyayitā bhavato mukhāditi |

skānde svetāraṇyamāhātmye (śtāraṇya-)(,) puṇḍarīkapuramāhātmye 

vyāghrapādasuto yatra purā snātvā mahāmuniḥ |
śivāgamasya vai pāraṃ gato'prāpyaṃ surairapi ||

yasya śiṣyo'bhavat kṛṣṇastattīrthaṃ navamaṃ smṛtamiti |

upadeśakāṇḍe ca(-)

punaśca vasudevasya daivakyāṃ kṛṣṇarūpadhṛk |
jajñe viṣṇurameyātmā bhṛgumāpa niyantritaḥ ||

tatrābhyarcya mahādevaṃ kṛtvā śatrujayaṃ punaḥ |
upamanyu samāsādya vidhinā tena dīkṣitaḥ ||

śaivamukhyastato tīrthaṃ (-tatastīrthaṃ) bhaktyārādhya ca śaṅkaram |
bhūbhāramapanīyātha viṣṇulokaṃ jagāma sa iti ||

tatraiva bāṇāsuraṃ prati śivavacanaṃ 

tamāha pūrvavannaiṣa jetuṃ śakyastvayāsura |
idānīṃ mama bhaktāgnyādupamanyormahātmanaḥ ||

<p. 19> śivadīkṣāsya

śivāgamānāṃ pānaṃ ca śaivācāryatvameva ca |
labdhvā ca paramaṃ yogaṃ śivasārūpatāṃ (-rūpyatāṃ) gatam ||

yasya nāmnā vanamidaṃ kathitaṃ savanatraye |
avanāyāsya bhaktasya śvetanāma nṛpasya tviti ||

nirvṛttaṃ śivāgamaviśāradāt 

bhasmadhārī ca satataṃ vīryavān bhaktisaṃyuta iti |

tatraiva 

so'pi saṃprāpya nityatvaṃ mārkaṇḍeyo mahāmuniḥ |
svagṛhaṃ prāpya parayā prītyā pitroḥ samāvasat ||

ananyasadṛśo loke śivaśāstraviśāradaḥ |
śivāgamārthavijñānasaṃpanno'dyāpi vartata iti ||

kiṃ tu śrutipathagalitānāṃ mānuṣāṇāṃ tu tantramityatra tantraṃ 
nādarūpaṃ viniṣkrāntaṃ śāstraṃ sarvamiti śruternādātmā 
śivakṛtavarṇapadavākyaracanātmanā 
śambhupadopalakṣitaśrīrīśvarapreritamāyā rudrakṛtaṃ 
vāmāditantramiti matimadūhyam | taduktaṃ kāmike 

vāmaṃ pāśupataṃ caiva lākulaṃ caiva bhairavam |
na sevyametat kathitaṃ vedabāhyaṃ tathetaramiti ||

<p. 20> sūtasaṃhitāvṛttau ca vidyāraṇyasvāmibhiḥ śivāgamodāharaṇaṃ 
svīkṛtya likhitvā guruṇā copadiṣṭo'pi tantrasaṃbandhavarjita ityatra | 
tantrasaṃbandha iti | kāpālaṃ lākulaṃ 
vāmamityādivedaviruddhāgamasaṃsargarahita iti vyākhyātam |

tathā hālāsyamāhātmye vikramapāṇḍyacarite pāṇḍyasya 
vedabāhyaśāstrāṇi parityajya śivaśāstrasya śravaṇaṃ śrutam |

prasṛtā vaidikā dharmāḥ sarvataḥ kṣitimaṇḍale |
vedabāhyamanā ye ca te gacchanti sudūrataḥ ||

sadā śaivāni śāstrāṇi purāṇāni śubhāni ca |
śṛṇoti vidvadvaktrebhyaḥ sāvadhānaśca sādaramiti ||

tathā śivāgamasya pūjyatvamuktaṃ vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ 

mannāmaniratā vāṇī vāṅmatāṃ (vāgmināṃ) mama netarā |
liṅgairmacchāsanoddiṣṭaistripuṇḍrādibhiraṅkitaḥ ||

mamopacāranirataḥ kāyaḥ kāyo na cetaraḥ |
madijyākarma vijñeyaṃ bāhyaṃ yādinocyate ||

madarthe dehasaṃśoṣastapaḥ kṛcchrādino mataḥ |
japaṃ pañcākṣarābhyāsaḥ praṇavābhyāsa eva ca ||

<p. 21> rudrādhyāyādikābhyāso na vedādhyayanādikam |
dhyānaṃ madrūpacintārthaṃ nānyadarthaṃ (******) yaḥ ||

mamāgamārthavijñānaṃ jñānaṃ nānyārthavedanamiti |

tathā yathākathañcitsāmānyaviśeṣatvavilakṣaṇatve'pi ubhābhyāṃ 
vedāntasiddhāntamārgābhyāmasaṃśayaṃ mokṣaprāptirasti | taduktaṃ 
skānde cidambaramāhātmye 

vedāntaniṣṭhitā ye tu jñānino vītakalmaṣāḥ |
madāgamaparā ye ca jñānapādairvyavasthitāḥ ||

ubhaye'pi ca vindanti sāyujyamatidurlabham |
ubhayeṣu ca mārgeṣu karma brahmapareṣu ca ||

vedāgamaprasiddheṣu ye na tiṣṭhanti pāpinaḥ |
caturvidhaiśca te daṇḍyā daṇḍaiḥ śāstrapracoditairiti ||

ubhaye'pi ca vindanti sāyujyamatidurlabhamiti śruterayaṃ vivekaḥ | 
siddhāntānusāriṇo vedāntino'pi vedāntajñatve'pi 
prakṛtyūrdhvaśivāgamamātrasiddharāgādiśivatattvāntapadārtha(-)
jñānārthaṃ mokṣārthaṃ ca śivadīkṣāvantaḥ santaḥ sadyaḥ 
satyaśivasāyujyaṃ vindanti | śivadīkṣārāhitye vedāntajñatve'pi na 
sākṣādvindantīti | taduktaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ 

<p. 22> sthāpayitvā guruḥ śiṣyaṃ maṇṭapasya tu madhyame |
granthicchedaṃ punaḥ kuryāt (kuryād) guruktenaiva vartmanā ||

kṛte kāruṇikenaivamācāryeṇa dvijottamāḥ |
mahādevo mahānando mahākāruṇikottamaḥ ||

svātmabhūtāṃ parāṃ śaktiṃ prerayatyeva suvratām |
prasannā sā mahādevī mahākāruṇikottamā ||

śiṣyasyātmani cidrūpe svayaṃ patati nirmalā |
mahādevasya bhaktaścet śiṣyaḥ sadgurubhaktimān ||

tasya śiṣyasya viprendrāḥ karmasāmye matidvijāḥ |
śāmbhavī śaktiratyarthaṃ tasmin patati ciddhane ||

tasya prasādayuktasya vidyā vedāntavākyajā |
dahatyavidyāmakhilāmantassūryodayo yathā ||

śaktipātavihīno'pi satyavāk gurubhaktimān |
ācāryācchrutavedāntaḥ kramānmucyeta bandhanāt ||

śaktipātaprakārasya rahasyāṃśaśca kaścana |
mayā nokto rahasyatvāt rājñā bhaṅgabhayādapīti ||

atrāpyayaṃ vivekaḥ | śaktirdīkṣākarmasaṃpādayitrī satī tataḥ pūrvaṃ 
sāmānyarūpiṇī patati(,) paścāddīkṣākarmaṇi 

<p. 23> karmaṇi sākṣāddīkṣātmikā satī viśeṣarūpiṇī patati | tathā patatī 
śaktiḥ |

tasmādvaidikamārgeṇa malanāśo na vidyate |
śaivāgamoktamārgeṇa dīkṣayā mokṣa eva hīti ||

devyāmatavacanāt malamauḍhyātmikāmavidyāṃ kramato dahati | 
dīkṣānantaraṃ vedāntavākyajā vidyā 
pṛthivyādiprakṛtyantatattvaviṣayātmanātmanyātmajñānādirūpaṃ 
prakṛtijāmavidyāṃ kramato dahati | paścāt siddhāntavākyajā vidyā 
rāgatattvādiśivatattvāntatattvaviṣayāṃ tathābhūtāṃ 
māyājāmavidyāṃ kramato dahatīti tāvatkālaṃ prakṛterūrdhvaṃ 
puruṣatattvabhuvanaṃ prāpya mahābhogaṃ bhuñjatīti tātparyam | 
taduktaṃ sarvajñānottarādike 

tāmasaṃ jinabhaktānāṃ pauruṣaṃ brahmavādinām |
nāsato vidyate bhāvo nābhāvo vidyate sataḥ ||

tasmādekātmavādo'yaṃ kalpito mūḍhacetanaiḥ |
ityadvaitagrahāviṣṭāḥ pralapanti dayālubhiḥ ||

gurubhiḥ pratibodhyante siddhāntāgamadāyibhiḥ |
advaitabalamāśritya ye viśṛṅkhalavṛttayaḥ ||

<p. 24> teṣāmadvaitaniṣṭhāṃ puṃstattve vilayo bhavet |

vedāntajñāśca sāṃkhyāśca yoginaḥ puruṣe sthitā iti | 
kvacitkathañcidvedopabṛṃhaṇatvena śivāgamānāṃ saumyatvamuktaṃ 
tanna pāramārthikam | kintu saumyatvaṃ svābhāvikam |

taduktaṃ kāmike 

tathā pāśupataṃ somasiddhāntākhyaṃ ca lākulam |
gāruḍaṃ bhairavaṃ vāmaṃ bhūtatantraṃ ca yāmalam ||

kāpālaṃ pāñcarātraṃ ca bauddhamapyārhataṃ tathā |
bṛhaspatimataṃ sāṃkhyaṃ yogaṃ vaighānasastathā ||

vedāntākhyaṃ ca mīmāṃsā purāṇaṃ dharmaśāstrakam |
vastuśāstraṃ tathā sūtraṃ ṣaḍaṅgamitihāsakam ||

tathā vedāśca catvāro yattatra paricoditam |
sarvaṃ raudraṃ samādiṣṭaṃ sidhāntaṃ saumyamiṣyate ||

raudraiśca sthāpitaṃ yacca viṣṇvādipratimādikam |
tatsarvaṃ śaivamāpādya śaivaḥ samarcayet ||

liṅgādyamādiśaivena sthāpitaṃ pūjitaṃ tu vā |
tadrūpaṃ pūjitaṃ taiścedrāṣṭraṃ rājānameva hi ||

<p. 25> tadgrāmaṃ grāmasaṃsthāṃśca sarvā hanti na saṃśayaḥ |
yajanaṃ trividhaṃ proktaṃ uttamaṃ madhyamādhamam ||

kevalaṃ śivamantraistu yajanaṃ cottamaṃ bhavet |
vaidikaiḥ śivamantraiśca yajanaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet ||

kevalaṃ vaidikairmantrairyajanaṃ cādhamaṃ bhavet |
kevalaṃ śaivikairmantrairyajedātmārthamuttamam ||

śaivamantrasamo mantro nāstīti bhuvanatraya iti |

skānde yuddhakāṇḍe kumāraviśvarūpapradarśanādhyāye 

śabdajālamaśeṣaṃ tat karṇadeśe samāśritam |
āsyamadhye sthitā vedā devadevasya bhūsurāḥ ||

akṣarāṇi ca danteṣu jihvāyāṃ tu śivāgamāḥ |
saptakoṭimahāmantrā oṣṭhamadhye vyavasthitā iti ||

cidambaramāhātmye 

iti devān samāhūya dhvajaṃ vṛṣabhalāñchitam |
puraṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya sabheśasya tu sannidhau ||

dṛḍhamāropayāmāsurāgamoktena vartmaneti |

śivapurāṇe (******) nāthamāhātmye 

śivārcanaṃ tapo mukhyaṃ vedāgamanirūpitam |
tapassiddhipradasthānaṃ puṇḍarīkapuraṃ mahaditi ||

<p. 26> śivapurāṇe ekāmranāthamāhātmye indrasya śivapūjāprakaraṇe 

bra (******) śśivatantroktairvratahomajapādibhiḥ |
pratyahaṃ prīṇayāmāsa kāmākṣīramaṇaṃ śivamiti ||

śivapurāṇe viriñcimāhātmye 

śivanāyaka ityāsīcchivabhūsuranāyakaḥ |
kāmikādyāgamārthajñaḥ sākṣādiva maheśvara iti ||

śivapurāṇe kālahastimāhātmye 

suvarṇamukharīsnāto jāpāgamikānmanūn |
prāyaścittavidhānena prasannātmā sa bhūsuraḥ ||

yathātantraṃ prayujyeśaṃ yavau bhūyastapovanamiti |

śaivapurāṇe puṇḍarīkamāhātmye 

śivaśāstraṃ likhitvā yo dadāti śivayogine |
raudra bhaktisaṃyuktaḥ śivasāyujyamāpnuyāditi ||

hālāsyapuramāhātmye 

mahāliṅgasya pūjārthaṃ śivasṛṣṭidvijottamān |
gaṅgātīrasthaniratān samāhūya mahīpatiḥ ||

sidhāntaiḥ kāmikādyaistu mahāliṅaṃ nirantaram |
pūjayantviti saṃprārthya vṛttiṃ tebhyaḥ pradāya ceti ||

<p. 27> punastatraiva 

gaṅgātīrthasya salilairhemakumbhasusaṃbhṛtaiḥ |
śivāgamoktairvidhibhirabhiṣiñcat sahotsavamiti ||

vedāraṇyamāhātmye kuleśvaravaibhave 

āgamoktena mārgeṇa pūjayāmāsurādarāt |
sudhārūpaṃ maheśānaṃ śaṅkaraṃ śaśibhūṣaṇamiti ||

śivapurāṇe rāmeśvaramāhātmye 

mantrairāgamikaistaistairmahitaṃ rāmapūjitam |
rāmeśvareti liṅgaṃ tu tadāprabhṛti papratha iti ||

āgamādipadanirvacanaṃ coktamaṃśumadādike |

āgataṃ śivavaktrāttu gataṃ ca girijāmukhe |
mataṃ ca ṛṣibhiḥ sarvairyasya āgama īritaḥ ||

tattvamāgamyate yena āgamo veti ca smṛtaḥ |
tato'tivipulānarthāṃ stattvamantrasamāśritān ||

trāṇaṃ ca kurute puṃsāṃ tena tantramiti smṛtamiti |


[iti śivāgamamāhātmyaṃ samāptam] ||




[dīkṣāmāhātmyam]

	taditthaṃ bhūtaṃ śivaśāstraṃ proktaprakāraṃ dīkṣitaireva 
śrotavyaṃ paṭhitavyaṃ ca | dīkṣāvihīne tu jñānādikaṃ sarvaṃ 
vyarthaṃ syāt | 
<p. 28> jñānāderasvātantryāddīkṣāṅgatvenaiva jñānādikaṃ 
mokṣasādhanaṃ nānyathā taduktam (tasya tena tadaṅgatvaṃ)

tasya tena tadaṅgatvaṃ dīkṣā sātoṅginī bhavet |
śivadīkṣāṃ tu muktvaikāṃ sapatrāvyāhatāṃ parām ||

jñānato yogataścāpi caryātaśca na mucyate |
jñānādīnāṃ tu sāmarthyaṃ tatrāpi svarna vidyate ||

bālabālīśavṛddhastrī bhogināṃ sarujāṃ tathā |
jñānādinā na mokṣo'sti tasmāddīkṣaiva mocinīti ||

kevalaṃ jñānādeva mokṣa ityatrāpi jñānaśabdasya dīkṣādirevārthaḥ |

taduktaṃ suprabhede 

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi jñānapādaṃ samāsataḥ |
tasyādau śivasṛṣṭiśca śṛṇuṣvaikāgramānasaḥ ||

jñānaṃ pravarttate vatsa klāntinirṇāśanāya ca |
adhvaśreṇivināśāya śivavyaktikarāya ca ||

andhakāravadajñānaṃ jñānaṃ dīpavaducyate |
jñeyaṃ bhāskaravatproktaṃ paścād jñānaṃ vinaśyati ||

pāśajālāni vicchedya dīkṣādirjñānamucyate |
paśupāśapatitvaṃ ca jñānenāśrayate budhaḥ ||

<p. 29> jñānenaiva tu kaivalyaprāptistatra na saṃśaya iti |

dīkṣā ca dīkṣākarmaṇyabhivyaktānā |

vinejyānalakarmādimanovyāpāramātrataḥ |
dīkṣājñānavatī proktā samyaktattvāvabodhikā ||

ijyānalavatī yā tu kriyākauśalyasaṃbhavā |
kriyāvatyatha sānekā nirbījātha sabījikā ||

kālottare 

dīkṣā kriyāvatī proktā brāhmaṇādicatuṣṭaye |
punarhautrī tridhā proktā (-----------------------------------------------------) ||

vāmane 

śāmbhavī caiva śāktī ca māntrī ceti śivāgame |
dīkṣopadiśyate tredhā śivena paramātmanā ||

nāsāgrācchulikā yāvat tattvajñānadṛśā guruḥ |
gurorālokamātreṇa sparśāt sambhāṣaṇādapi ||

sadyaḥ saṃjāyate cātra pāśopakṣeyakāriṇī |
sā dīkṣā śāmbhavī proktā sā punarbhidyate dvidhā ||

tīvrā tīvratarā ceti pāśopakṣayabhedataḥ |
yathā syānnirvṛttiḥ sadyaḥ saiva tīvratarā matā ||

<p. 30> tīvrā tu jīvato'tyantaṃ puṇyapāpaviśodhikā |
śāktī jñānavatī dīkṣā śiṣyadehaṃ praviśya ca ||

guruṇā yogamārgeṇa kriyate jñānacakṣuṣā |
māntrī kriyāvatī dīkṣā kuṇḍamaṇḍapapūrvikā ||

mandamandataroddeśāt karttavyā guruṇā bahiḥ |
jñānena kriyayā vātha guruḥ śiṣyaṃ viśodhayet ||

yo'nyathā kurute mohāt sa vinaśyati durmatiriti |
ekā jñānavatī proktā dvitīyā tu kriyāvatīti ca ||

śrīmaccintyaviśvasādākhye proddhṛtyoktvā punaḥ 

evaṃ māntrī kriyā dīkṣā saṃpanno guṇasattamaḥ |
sa eva yogadīkṣāyāmadhikārī ca nānyathā ||

pūrvadīkṣāsamāyuktaśiṣyāṇāmuttamaṃ tathā |
praṇavaṃ śaktisaṃbhūtaṃ śāmbhavaṃ trividhaṃ bhavet ||

śāktī śāmbhavadīkṣā ca kriyate tattvayā mayā |
anyairāṇavadīkṣā tu mandatīvrādibhedataḥ iti ca proktam |

anyairapi yogabalavadgurubhiḥ kriyādīkṣāmantarāpi atipakve'tidaridre vā 
mantrādivaikalyakṛtakriyādīkṣe vā 
śāktiśāmbhavyorekatarāsvāntaritānyā ca kāryeti guravaḥ |


<p. 31> yathākathañcitkṛtābhyāsayogibhirapi gurubhirmantrakriyābhāvanā 
sāṅgopāṅgasākalyavatyā kriyādīkṣayā dīkṣitasya kṛtasya 
karaṇāsaṃbhavāditi nyāyāttadetatkriyā dīkṣāṅgatayā sadyaḥ 
samuccaritaprāsādamantrasamuddhṛtikṛtaśivayojanaṣāṅguṇyodaya(-)
śivatvābhivyaktisaṃpādikā tanmantramantrātmikā satī saha saṃkṣiptā 
śāktī śāmbhavī ca sahakāryetyapyartho'ntaḥ sphurati | 
tadettattrividhadīkṣāvihīnaḥ paśuḥ | taduktaṃ 

caturvedadharo vipraḥ śivadīkṣāvivarjitaḥ |
duṣṭacāṇḍālabhāṇḍeṣu yathā bhāgīrathījalam ||

koṭiviprasamaḥ śūdraḥ śivadīkṣāsamanvitaḥ |
sudurlabhaṃ śivajñānaṃ tadabhyāsaśca sudurlabhaḥ ||

sudurlabhamidaṃ jñātvā śive bhaktiṃ samācarediti ||

[iti śivadīkṣāmāhātmyaṃ samāptam] ||




[śivabhaktamāhātmyam]

tataḥ śivaśāstraṃ śivadīkṣayā dīkṣitaiścaturvarṇaireva paṭhitavyam | 
taduktaṃ suprabhede 

sādhu sādhu mahāprājña yattvayā paricoditam |
<p. 32> śuddhaśaivamidaṃ tantraṃ na deyaṃ na prakāśyakam ||

dīkṣitasyaiva dhīrasya śivabhaktiparasya ca |
śrāvaṇīyaṃ na cānyatra kathanaṃ hi praśasyate ||

caturṇāṃ śuddhaśaivānāṃ dīkṣayā prāpayecchivam |
laukikācāramārgeṇa sarveṣāṃ vartanaṃ śṛṇu ||

adhyayanaṃ cādhyāpanaṃ yajanaṃ yājanaṃ tathā |
śivamuddiśya yaddravyaṃ dattaṃ taddānameva ca ||

pratigrahaṃ tato vātha tasya ṣaṭkarma ucyate |
śivasadbhāvayuktasya śuddhaśaivasya dhīmata || iti ||

makuṭe 

nirvāṇadīkṣitānāṃ tu dātavyaṃ śivayoginām |
anyeṣāṃ tu na dātavyamidaṃ tantramanuttamamiti ||

kāñcīpuramāhātmye ca 

brāhmaṇaṃ vedavidvāṃsaṃ śivabhaktaṃ jitendriyam |
bhūtirudrākṣasaṃpannaṃ śivapūjāparāyaṇam ||

āgamārthaparijñānanirataṃ śivadharmiṇam |
kṣattryaṃ vaiśyamapi vā śūdraṃ vā pratilomajam ||

anulomodbhavaṃ vāpi sākṣādāmreśasaṃśrayam |
bhaktyā vittānusāreṇa gṛhakṣetradhanādibhiḥ ||

<p. 33> vāsayedadhikā (******) śe caraṇāmbhojabhaktitaḥ |
pratiṣṭhayā tu devānāṃ yatphalaṃ tadudīritam ||

tatphalaṃ sakalaṃ labdhvā mucyate bhavasāgarāditi |

śaivapurāṇe 

idaṃ hi śivabhaktāya śivaśāstrāvalokine |
śivadīkṣāviśuddhāya prakāśyaṃ munipuṅgavā iti |

tathā kiraṇavṛttau bhagavatā rāmakaṇṭhācāryeṇa | 
ata evāsya nirvāṇadīkṣā saṃpanneti pratīyate |

nādīkṣitānāṃ śravaṇādhikāra iti vakṣyatītyupakramya yadavāpya 
narāḥ sarva ityatra sarva iti brāhmaṇāḥ kṣattryā vaiśyāḥ śūdrā 
mlecchādayo'pi hīti śrutyadhikāriṇa eva garutmato'dhikāraprakramataḥ 
sarvapadasyāniyatārthatvāditi vyākhyātam | na tu dīkṣāvihīnaiḥ 
paṭhitavyam |

taduktaṃ kāmike 


dīkṣāvihīnā viprādyāstrivarṇāḥ śudrajātayaḥ |
paṭhanti śivaśāstraṃ cedrājarāṣṭraṃ vinaśyati ||

cintyaviśve 

viprādyadīkṣitenaiva śivajñānaṃ na lekhayet |
adīkṣitasakāśe tu nādhyetavyaṃ viśeṣata iti ||

<p. 34> vīratantre 

nādīkṣitaistu śrotavyaṃ na deyaṃ na prakāśyakam |
śiṣyāṇāṃ caiva dātavyaṃ samāsāt kathayāmi ta iti ||

anyatra ca 

paśunā lekhayennaiva śivajñānaṃ prayatnataḥ |
na samīpe paśūnāṃ ca kuryādadhyayanaṃ budha iti ||

caturvarṇeṣvapi dīkṣitā eva śreṣṭhāḥ | taduktaṃ śaivapurāṇe 

gataṃ śūdrasya śūdratvaṃ dvijatvaṃ brāhmaṇasya ca |
śivasaṃskārasaṃbandhājjātibhedo na vidyate ||

śivadīkṣābhijātasya pūrvajātiṃ na cintayet |
saṃpratiṣṭhitaliṅge tu na yathāpūrvabhāvaneti ||

śivadharme 

sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ caiva dvividhaṃ liṅgamiṣyate |
sthāvaraṃ sthāpitaṃ liṅgaṃ jaṅgamaṃ dīkṣitaṃ viduḥ ||

jaṅgamasyāvamānena sthāvaraṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet |
tasmālliṅgadvayaṃ prājño nāvamanyena sarvadeti ||

śrīmatmataṅge 

śivavacchiva (******) śivakāṅkṣibhiḥ |
saṃskṛtāśca śivairmantrairguruṇā mantramūrttinā ||

<p. 35> vāgīśīgarbhasaṃbhūtāssarve prāptavarā narāḥ |
yathoktaśivasaṃskārapavitrīkṛtamūrtayaḥ ||

sarve samānadharmāṇastathāpyeṣa vidhīyata iti ||

kāmike 

indhanaṃ vahnisaṃyogādvṛkṣanāma na vidyate |
gataṃ śūdrasya śūdratvaṃ dvijatvaṃ brāhmaṇasya tu ||

śivasaṃskārasaṃbandhājjātibhedo na vidyata iti |

anyatra ca 

kāñcanaṃ rājataṃ tāmraṃ lohaṃ ceti catuṣṭayam |
tatprayāti suvarṇatvaṃ rasabhedaprabhāvataḥ ||

rasasiddhaṃ yathā tāmraṃ na bhūyastāmratāṃ vrajet |
jñānasiddhastathā dehī na bhūyaḥ śūdratāṃ vrajet ||

yathā śuktigataṃ toyaṃ mauktikaṃ jāyate dhruvam |
na punastoyatāṃ yāti mauktikatvaṃ na muñcatīti ||

jñānalakṣaṇasamuccaye 

vāgīśī jananī yasya vyomavyāpī pitā śivaḥ |
mantraiḥ śivādhvare jātaḥ sa śudraḥ syāt kathaṃ tviti ||

mṛdbhāvanā ghaṭādīnāṃ saṃskārānna kadā yathā |
tathaiva pāśahānācca na prākṛtyastu jātayaḥ ||

<p. 36> narāṇāṃ śivasaṃskārāt śivatvaṃ na bhavedyadi |
na bhaveyustadā nūnaṃ dvijadevādideśikāḥ ||

mantrasaṃskāradīkṣābhiḥ saṃskṛtaṃ guruṇā sadā |
carācaraṃ prapadyeta śivatvaṃ tatkṣaṇād dhruvamiti ||

cintyaviśve 

śivaliṅge śilābuddhiṃ kurvāṇa iva pātakī |
śreṣṭhatvaṃ vidyate tasya dīkṣayā tu viśeṣataḥ ||

yasya cittaṃ bhavellīnaṃ tasya jātyādi na smaret ||

yasya cittaṃ bhavellīnaṃ tasya jātyādi na smaret |
śūdrajātiṃ samuddhṛtya svāhāntenaiva mūlataḥ ||

skandakālottare 

jātyuddharaṇahomaṃ tu ekaikaṃ tu śataṃ śatam |
dahedvai śūdrajātiṃ tu analena tu ṣaṇmukha ||

sacchūdratvaṃ yojayitvā kriyāṃ vai ṣoḍaśaṃ kuru |
sākṣādvipratvamāpanne paścāddīkṣāṃ kuruṣvatha ||

traivarṇikānāmevaṃ tu kārayedvidhinā budha iti ||

kāmike 

namo vauṣaṭ ca śūdrasya praṇavādivivarjitam |
nirvāṇadīkṣito yastu praṇavena tu yojayediti ||

<p. 37> makuṭe ca 

nirvāṇadīkṣitendre praṇavaṃ tu niyojayediti |

suprabhede 

yatīnāṃ śuddhaśaivānāṃ martyamāheśvarātmanām |
viśeṣabhojanaṃ dānaṃ kuryāttatraiva śaktita iti ||

adīkṣitā yadyapi śivabhaktā muktabhaktītare'pyaśreṣṭhā bhavanti | 
śivabhaktalakṣaṇamuktamupadeśakāṇḍe 

śivabhaktā mahātmānaḥ santi deveṣu kecana |
daityeṣu yātudhāneṣu yakṣagandharvabhogiṣu ||

munīśvareṣu martyeṣu brāhmaṇeṣu nṛpeṣvapi |
ūrujeṣvapi śūdreṣu saṃkareṣvapi sarvaśaḥ ||

varṇāśramavyavasthāśca naiṣāṃ santi munīśvarāḥ |
kevalaṃ śivarūpāste sarve māheśvarāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

ativarṇāśramāḥ proktāḥ sarvavedeṣu sattamā iti |

vāyavyasaṃhitāyāṃ 

evamaṣṭavidhaṃ liṅgaṃ yasmin mlecche'pi vartate |
sa viprendre muniḥ śrīmān sa yatiḥ sa ca paṇḍitaḥ ||

na me priyaścaturvedī madbhaktaḥ śvapaco'piyaḥ |
tasmai deyaṃ tato grāhyaṃ sa ca pūjyo yathā hyahamiti ||

<p. 38> vāsiṣṭhalaiṅge 

śiveti vācaṃ yo nityaṃ caṇḍālo'pi vadenmudā |
saha tena vadedvācaṃ saha tena vaset sadeti ||

vṛddhācalamāhātmye ca 

cihnairyuto vipravaraśca vidvān
	yadi śvapāko'pi sa eva bhaktaḥ |
nānyaścaturvedadharo'pi pūjyo
	deyaṃ ca tasmai saśivasvarūpaḥ ||

upadeśakāṇḍe 

pāpiṣṭhasyāpi vai muktirbhasmarudrākṣadhāriṇaḥ |
iti sarvatra vedeṣu purāṇeṣvāgameṣvapi ||

vahudhā gaṇyate loke sarvairapi mahātmabhiriti |

bhaktilakṣaṇaṃ coktaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ 

śivajñānaikaniṣṭhānāṃ śivajñānasya suvrata |
dūṣakasya śiracchedaḥ śivabhaktiḥ pratīyate ||

lekhanaṃ śivavidyāyāḥ pradānaṃ pustakasya ca |
śivabhaktiriti proktā śivaśāstraviśāradairiti ||

kiraṇe 

bhojyamannaṃ trayāṇāṃ tu śūdrānnaṃ na kadācana |
<p. 39> śaucācārasamāyuktāḥ śūdrā ye madyapāḥ śubhāḥ ||

rudrārcanaparā bhaktā bhojyante bhogyajānapīti |

[iti śivabhaktamāhātmyam samāptam] ||




[ādiśaivādimāhātmyam]

kāmike 

ṛṣīṇāmapi sarveṣāṃ vakṣye gotravinirṇayam |
dvividhaṃ gotramatroktaṃ dīkṣotthaṃ jātijaṃ tathā ||

kauśikaḥ kāśyapaścaiva bharadvājottha gautamaḥ |
agastyo'trirvasiṣṭhastu jamadagniśca bhārgavaḥ ||

aṅgirāśca manuścādyo dvividhāśca prakīrtitāḥ |
śivasṛṣṭisamopetā munayastadvivarjitāḥ ||

śivasṛṣṭyanvitāścaite pañcavaktreṣu dīkṣitāḥ |
śivena tatkulotthāḥ syuḥ śaivāḥ sāntānikā dvijāḥ ||

ādiśaivāstu te jñeyāḥ sarvānugrāhakāḥ smṛtāḥ |

<p. 40> suprabhede 

dīkṣitānāṃ dvijātīnāmātmārthamanulominām |
parārthamādiśaivānāmātmārthasahitaṃ bhavet ||

kāmike 

vṛttyarthaṃ ye śivaṃ viprāḥ sāmānyāstvarcayanti cet |
ṣāṇmāsāt patanaṃ yānti yasmāttān parivarjayet ||

śivadīkṣāviśuddhasya śivaviprasya dhīmataḥ |
śivājñāvaśatastasya parārthe jñānadoṣadā ||

śilpe 

śivārcanaṃ śaivaśivadvijānāṃ 
	vaighānasaṃ pūjanameva viṣṇoḥ |
tathārcayedanyamahīsuraśce 
	ccaṇḍālakaṃ devalakaṃ vadanti ||

anyatra 

adīkṣitastu viprāṇāṃ ṣāṇmāsaṃ pūjayedyadi |
ṣāṇmāsātpatanaṃ yānti sa vai devalakaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

vīratantre 

(vṛ)bhūtyarthaṃ sarvadā kālamādiśaivaḥ śivaṃ yajet |
tacca svadharmānuṣṭhānaṃ na doṣāya prakalpate ||

<p. 41> adīkṣitaścaturvedī śivaliṅgaṃ tu na spṛśet |
dīkṣitaścāpi yo vipro vratyarthaṃ tu na pūjayet ||

ātmārthapūjanaṃ kuryāt parārthaṃ naiva pūjayet |

vīratantre 

adīkṣitaścaturvedī śivapūjāṃ na kārayet |
vṛttyai ca ye pūjayanti dīkṣāvidhivivarjitāḥ ||

ṣāṇmāsātpatanaṃ yānti te vai devalakāḥ smṛtāḥ |
trīṇi varṣāṇi vṛttyarthaṃ sthiraliṅgeṣu dīkṣitaḥ ||

pūjayedyadi viprastu sa vai devalakaḥ smṛtaḥ |

śaivaratnākare 

adīkṣitaśca yo vipraścaturvedaparo'pi vā |
saṃsparśedyadi vā liṅgaṃ śvāno vā spṛśite yadi ||

adīkṣitaśca yo vipraḥ kuryālliṅgasya pūjanam |
araṇye nirjale deśe bhavati brahmarākṣasaḥ ||

caturvedeṣvahaṅkārī śivaliṅgaṃ tu pūjayet |
rājarāṣṭrā vinaśyanti tasya grāmo vinaśyati ||

yo'rcayet mantrapūrvaṃ tu sarve devalakaḥ smṛtaḥ |


<p. 42> yogaje 

adīkṣitaścaturvedī parārthapūjāṃ na kārayet |

santāne 

adīkṣito'pi yo vipraḥ ṣāṇmāsaṃ tu śivaṃ spṛśet |
so'pi devalakaḥ prokto sa nārho devapūjane ||

dīkṣitaścāpi yo vipro vṛttyarthaṃ vatsaratrayam |
pūjayedyadi deveśaṃ so'pi devalako bhavet ||

makuṭe 

viprakṣatriyaviṭśūdrā dīkṣitāśca praveśakāḥ |
ātmārthayajanaṃ kuryurna kuryustu parārthakam ||

aṃśumati 

viprakṣatriyavaiśyāśca śūdrāścaiva tu dīkṣitāḥ |
ātmārthayajanaṃ kuryurna kuryustu parārthakam ||

cāturvarṇodbhava (*) ṇāmarcanaṃ tu viśeṣataḥ |

kāmike 

śivāya śivaviprebhyo dadyādgāṃ dakṣiṇānvitām |
daśaniṣkaṃ tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ niṣkameva vā ||

tatraiva 

parārthayajanaṃ kāryaṃ śivavipreṇa nityaśaḥ |
dhārmikaḥ kathyate nityamādiśaivo dvijottamaḥ ||

<p. 43> anyeṣāṃ svārthamevaṃ syāt kuryuścetkartṛnāśanam |
śivasṛṣṭiṃ vinā ye tu jāyante brahmaṇo mukhāt ||

te sāmānyā ne teṣāṃ tu parārtheṣvādhikāritā |
yadi mohena kurvīran rājño rāṣṭrasya nāśanam ||

tatraiva 

tasmātparārthamātmārthaṃ (******) panaṃ (******) panaṃ tathā |
śivavipreṇa kartavyamanyeṣāṃ svārthameva hi ||

parārthamapi kuryāccellobhena nṛpatestadā |
tadrāṣṭrasya vināśaḥ syādacireṇa na saṃśayaḥ ||

tatraiva 

viparītakriyāṃ dṛṣṭvāpyaudāsīnyāt karoti yaḥ |
sa rājā kṣayamāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

tasmādācāryavaryeṇa pañcagocaravartinā |
śaivāgamaparijñānapārageṇa kriyāvatā ||

kriyā nirvartyamānā syāt svasvarāṣṭrābhivṛddhaye |

tatraiva 

śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ karma kāryaṃ rājñāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
anyeṣāmapi sarveṣāmābhicārādikaṃ tu vā ||

<p. 44> vidheyaṃ dharmānuṣṭhena sāntānikapareṇa tu |
tenaivānuṣṭhitaṃ karma kāmadaṃ sarvadā nṛṇām ||

tatraiva 

ādiśaivena karttavyā na cānyaiśca viśeṣataḥ |
anyaścaiva kṛtā cettu niṣphalā sā bhavettathā ||

tatraiva 

ādiśaivasya karttavyamātmārthaṃ ca parārthakam |
sthāpanaṃ yajanaṃ caiva ādiśaivārhakaṃ bhavet ||

anyena yat kṛtaṃ karma ābhicāramiti smṛtam |

tatraiva 

ādiśaivena karttavyaṃ pratiṣṭhādyarcanāntakam |
anyathā kārayedyastu niṣphalaṃ tadavāpnuyāt ||

suprabhede 

caryāpāde tu yannoktaṃ sāmānyaśvetavaccaret |
tacca bodhāyane sūtre dṛṣṭvā karma samācaret ||

tasmādbodhāyanenoktaṃ teṣāṃ sūtramudīritam |
ādiśaivā ime proktāḥ saṃkṣepānna tu vistarāt ||

yogaje 

ādiśaiva iti proktaḥ sa śivabrāhmaṇo guruḥ |
<p. 45> deśikaḥ sādhakaścaiva tasya paryāyavācakāḥ |

ādāveva tu śaivatvādādiśaiva iti smṛtaḥ |
śivena dīkṣitatvācca śivabrāhmaṇa ucyate ||

sarveṣāṃ tu gurutvācca gururityabhidhīyate |
deśa ādiśyate yena sa deśika iti smṛtaḥ ||

liṅgasthāpanayogyatvāt sthāpako nāma kīrttitaḥ ||

tatraiva 

ādiśaiva iti proktaḥ sa śivabrāhmaṇo guruḥ |
ādiśaivena dīkṣyāḥ syurmahāśaivā na śaivakāḥ ||

mahāśaivaṃ tu viprāṇāṃ nṛpāṇāmanuśaivakam |
vaiśyānāṃ bhogaśaivaṃ cāntaraśaivaṃ tu śūdrakam ||

ādiśaivādiśaivānāmādiśaivo gururbhavet |

kāmike 

ādiśaivakule jātaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ syāt sthāpanādiṣu |
viprādayaścaturvarṇā api yo (******) karmaṇi ||

dīkṣāyāṃ sarvamartyānāṃ pratiṣṭhā paramathotsave |
snapane prokṣaṇe'nyatra prāyaścitte'bhiṣecane ||

vyākhyānādau ca yuktaḥ syāt svārthe vātha parārthake |
sarvadevārcane caiva ādiśaivo gururmataḥ ||

<p. 46> makuṭe ca 

catuvarṇyasya (cā-) dīkṣāyāṃ viśeṣabrāhmaṇo guruḥ |
viprakṣatriyaviṭśūdrādīkṣitāśca praveśakāḥ ||

ātmārthayajanaṃ kuryurna kuryustu parārthakam |
ūrdhvaśaivena karttavyamātmārthaṃ ca parārthakam ||

ūrdhvaśaiva iti proktaḥ sa śivabrāhmaṇo guruḥ |

kāraṇe 

pañcaśaivāḥ samākhyātāḥ siddhānte tu prajāpate |
prathamo'nādiśaivaḥ syāt sa śaivastu sadāśivaḥ ||

ādiśaivo dvitīyastu śivaśvetaḥ sa ucyate |
ādau sadāśivenaiva dīkṣitastvādiśaivakaḥ ||

kauśikaḥ kāśyapaścaiva bharadvājo'tha gautamaḥ |
agastyaścaiva pañcaite pañcavaktreṣu dīkṣitāḥ ||

kauśikaḥ śivamūrtyā tu dīkṣitaḥ śivagocaraḥ |
kāśyapastvīśvareṇaiva śivāgocarasaṃsthitaḥ ||

īśānena bharadvājo dīkṣito jyotigocaraḥ |
gautamo brahmamūrtyā tu sāvitrī gocaraḥ smṛtaḥ ||

agastyaścordhvavaktreṇa dīkṣito vyomagocaraḥ |
ṛṣīṇāṃ caiva pañcānāṃ gocaratvaṃ prakīrttitam ||

<p. 47> ādiśaivā ime proktā gocaraṃ kulamucyate |
kuleṣveteṣu sañjātā sthāpanādikriyārhakāḥ ||

sadā pravartakāstvete ādiśaivā iti smṛtāḥ |
tṛtīyastu mahāśaivaḥ sa śaivo vipra ucyate ||

caturthamanuśaivaṃ ca nṛpavaiśyau tu tau smṛtau |
pañcamo'ntaraśaivastu sa śūdraśceti kathyate ||

śivastvanāśritaḥ prokta ādiśaivastamāśritaḥ |
ādiśaivāśritāḥ proktā mahāśaivānuśaivakāḥ ||

svāyambhuve 

siddhānteṣu samākhyātā pañcaśaivāścaturmukha |
anādiśaivaḥ prathamo hyādiśaivo dvitīyakaḥ ||

tṛtīyastu mahāśaivaścaturthaścānuśaivakaḥ |
kṛṣṇastvāntaraśaivaḥ syāt procyate te'dhunā kramāt ||

sa śivo nāśritaḥ proktaścādiśaivastamāśritaḥ |
anādyādyādiśaivāśca dīkṣitāstvādiśaivakāḥ ||

mahāśaivādayastvanye te viprādyāḥ praveśakāḥ |
prāptā praviśya yasmāttu śivatāṃ caturānana ||

tasmāt praveśaketyuktāścāmralepanatavāmravat |
praveśaketi nāmāpi sāmānyaṃ teṣu padmaja ||

<p. 48> suprabhede 

martyānāṃ malanāśāya teṣāṃ muktyarthameva ca |
parārthapūjanārthāya pareṣāṃ śodhanāya ca ||

sthāpanaprokṣaṇaṃ dīkṣāvidhānakaraṇāya ca |
ye śivānnirmitāstena śivena paramātmanā ||

te śaivā brahmavaktrācca matyalokaṃ gatā(ḥ) kramāt |
kāśyapādikanāmaiśca ṛṣirūpaiśca kīrttitāḥ ||

ādau śivatvamastīti ādiśaivā udīritāḥ |
śivena dīkṣitāḥ śvetāste śivabrāhmaṇāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

savyomāḥ paramācāryāḥ viprottamaśivottamāḥ |
dvijottamottamāścaiva śivaḥ śvetāḥ śivātmajāḥ ||

teṣāṃ paryāyanāmāni saṃkṣepāt kathitāni te |

tatraiva 

anuśaivāṃstu vakṣye'haṃ dīkṣitāḥ brāhmaṇāstvime |
