kṣatriyādyāstrayo varṇāḥ śaivāste'ntarasaṃjñakāḥ |
ādiśaivānuśaivairvā dīkṣā saṃpadyate kramāt ||

evamantaraśaivānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ ca samāsataḥ |
teṣāmantaraśaivānāmanuśaivo gururbhavet ||

<p. 49> teṣāṃ caivānuśaivānāmādiśaivo gururbhavet |
