gocaraṃ śivacihnaṃ hi gotraṃ svamunivargakam ||

<p. 68> sūtramācāramevaṃ hi śaivānāmucyate kramāt |
śivaḥ śikhā tathā jyotiḥ sāvitrīceti gocarāḥ ||

etaccaturthanāmāni śaivānāṃ śivaśāsane |
gocarami (******) taccihnaṃ ca caturvidham ||

kāśyapaḥ kauśikaścaiva bhāradvājo'tha gautamaḥ |
ete caturvidhā jñeyāḥ saṃproktā munayastviha ||

vrataṃ hi dvividhaṃ proktaṃ sāmānyaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
brahmacārī gṛhasthaśca vānaprastho'tha bhikṣukaḥ ||

caturāśrama evaṃ hi sāmānyavidhicoditam |
caturṇāṃ gocarāṇāṃ tu samanetacchivāgamiti ||

